"""
Cookiewars Multiplayer server
- Serves index.html (+ music/sounds, the jelly picture)
- Knows which characters exist (one per folder that has a .json + .atlas + .png), in this order:
    1. the local ./Cookiewars folder (the "texture" sub-folders are never served)
    2. your GitHub repo (the character files are hosted there with GitHub Pages)
    3. ./characters.txt (one folder name per line)  -> manual fallback
    4. ./characters_cache.json                      -> last successful list
- Handles the multiplayer WebSocket at /ws
"""
